# Drive B without a diskette, and no fixed disk D: the calls fail, within
# their limits, and the kernel goes on (tests/programs/storage.asm).
program: storage
define: STORAGE_MEDIA
media: B ejected
media: D absent
timeout: 60
emulators: bochs mame
---
rx286, test build
B: sector 0: error 5
B: sector 700: error 5
D: sector 0: error 5
